{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孤竹, 國名. 『易繇』曰：｢困于石, 據于蒺藜, 入于其宮, 不見其妻, 凶.｣. 棠姜, 齊 棠公之妻, 東郭偃之姊也. 武氏, 崔武子 杼, 見 『左傳』.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 38, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0010_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東郭棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "易繇", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "齊 棠公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "東郭偃", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "崔武子 杼", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "左傳", "type": "서명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0010_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第一 › 夬", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0010_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "夬\n○ 孤竹之墟, 失婦亡夫, 傷於蒺藜, 不見少妻, 東郭棠姜·武氏以亡.", "title": "夬", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 28, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『援神契』云：｢河者, 水之伯. 河伯, 水神.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 28, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 18, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0010_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "援神契", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0010_0020", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第一 › 大有", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0010_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "大有\n○ 河伯大呼, 津不可渡, 船空無人, 往來亦難.", "title": "大有", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孤竹, 國名. 『易繇』曰：｢困于石, 據于蒺藜, 入于其宮, 不見其妻, 凶.｣. 棠姜, 齊 棠公之妻, 東郭偃之姊也. 武氏, 崔武子 杼, 見 『左傳』.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 38, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0020_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東郭棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "易繇", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "齊 棠公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "東郭偃", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "崔武子 杼", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "左傳", "type": "서명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0020_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第二 › 剝", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0020_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "剝\n○ 孤竹之墟, 老婦無夫, 傷於蒺藜, 不見少妻, 東郭棠姜·武氏破亡.", "title": "剝", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 26, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "伯夷·叔齊, 孤竹君之二子. 武王伐紂, 諫之, 不食周粟, 遂餓而死. 『論語』云：｢伯夷·叔齊, 餓於首陽之下, 民到于今稱之.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 26, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 16, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0020_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "伯夷", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "叔齊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "伯夷", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "叔齊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孤竹君", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "論語", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "伯夷", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "叔齊", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "首陽", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0020_0020", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第二 › 剝", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0020_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "○ 伯夷·叔齊, 貞廉之師, 以德防患, 憂禍不存.", "title": "剝", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 33, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "河伯, 水神也.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 33, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 21, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0030_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0030_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第四 › 蠱", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0030_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "蠱\n○ 龍渴求飮, 黑雲影從, 河伯奉觴, 跪進酒漿, 流潦滂滂.", "title": "蠱", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [], "charCount": 86, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 58, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0040_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "大姬", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "胡公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "陳", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "箕伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "周", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0040_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第七 › 未濟", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0040_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "未濟\n○ 武王伐紂而有天下, 以元女大姬, 嫁胡公而封諸陳. 朝鮮之地, 箕伯所保, 宜人宜家, 業處子孫, 求事大吉. 箕子, 紂諸父. 武王伐紂, 遂歸周, 封於朝鮮.", "title": "未濟", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 39, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "箕子, 紂諸父, 紂爲不道, 乃佯狂而爲奴.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 39, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0040_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0040_0020", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第七 › 履", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0040_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "履\n○ 三手六身, 莫適所閑, 更相搖動, 失事便安. 箕子佯狂, 國乃不昌.", "title": "履", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "箕子, 紂諸父, 武王伐紂, 遂歸周, 封於朝鮮.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 27, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 17, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0050_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "周", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0050_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第八 › 革", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0050_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "革\n○ 朝鮮之地, 箕子所保, 宜家宜人, 業處子孫.", "title": "革", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 39, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "易明夷封彖曰：｢利艱貞, 晦其明也. 內艱而能正其志, 箕子以之.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 39, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0050_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0050_0020", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第八 › 睽", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0050_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "睽\n○ 日暮閉目, 隨陽休息. 箕子以之, 乃受其福, 擧首多言, 必爲悔殘.", "title": "睽", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "孤竹, 國名. 『易繇』曰：｢困于石, 據于蒺藜, 入于其宮, 不見其妻, 凶.｣. 棠姜, 齊 棠公之妻, 東郭偃之姊也. 武氏, 崔武子 杼, 出 『左傳』.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 38, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 25, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0060_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "東郭棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孤竹", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "易繇", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "棠姜", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "齊 棠公", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "東郭偃", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "崔武子 杼", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "左傳", "type": "서명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0060_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十 › 解", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0060_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "解\n○ 孤竹之墟, 失婦無夫, 傷於蒺藜. 不見其妻, 東郭棠姜·武氏以亡.", "title": "解", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 38, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『史記』 西門豹爲鄴令, 問民所疾苦, 皆曰：｢苦爲河伯娶婦, 不爲娶婦, 水漂人民.｣. 豹曰：｢至時來報, 吾亦往送女.｣. 至其時, 豹往河上, 使吏抱大巫, 投河中, 吏民驚恐. 從是, 不敢復言河伯娶婦矣.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 38, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 26, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0070_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "東山氏", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "史記", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "西門豹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "鄴", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "豹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "豹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "河", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0070_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十一 › 噬嗑", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0070_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "噬嗑\n○ 河伯娶婦東山氏女, 新婚三日, 浮雲洒雨, 雨我菅茅, 萬家之祐.", "title": "噬嗑", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "東方之夷, 有九種.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 27, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 17, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0080_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "遼", "type": "지명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0080_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十三 › 睽", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0080_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "睽\n○ 海隅遼右, 福祿所在, 柔嘉蒙禮, 九夷何咎.", "title": "睽", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 28, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "載祀六伯, 商之曆數也. 商頌曰：｢奄有九有, 卽九州也.｣. 又曰：｢濬哲維商, 長發其祥, 洪水茫茫, 禹敷下土方. 帝立子生商, 蓋商之封國, 在禹治水之時也.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 28, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 18, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0080_0020", "indexTerms": [{"text": "河伯", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "商", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "商", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "商", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "禹", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "土方", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "商", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "商", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "禹", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0080_0020", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十三 › 大有", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0080_0020", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "大有\n○ 河伯之功, 九州攸同, 載祀六百, 光烈無窮.", "title": "大有", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 28, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『語』云：｢子欲居九夷.｣. 註云：｢東方之夷, 有九種.｣.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 28, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 18, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0090_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "遼", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "語", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "子", "type": "이름"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0090_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十四 › 歸妹", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0090_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "歸妹\n○ 海隅遼右, 福祿所在, 柔嘉蒙祉, 九夷何咎.", "title": "歸妹", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
{"annotations": [{"id": null, "offset": 27, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "『史記』, 商 紂無道, 九年, 武王東觀兵于孟津, 有火自上復于下, 至於王屋. 流爲烏, 其色赤, 是時諸侯不期而會者八百, 遂伐紂而有天下, 箕子歸, 周封于朝鮮.", "type": "원주"}], "charCount": 27, "chunkType": "article", "date": null, "hanjaCount": 17, "id": "chunk_jipseong-ko_012_ko_012_0100_0010", "indexTerms": [{"text": "赤烏", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "史記", "type": "서명"}, {"text": "商 紂", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "武王", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "孟津", "type": "지명"}, {"text": "箕子", "type": "이름"}, {"text": "周", "type": "국명"}, {"text": "朝鮮", "type": "국명"}], "lang": "hanmun", "level": 3, "levelId": "ko_012_0100_0010", "locator": "易林 › 『易林』 卷第十六 › 豐", "newChars": [], "permalink": "https://db.history.go.kr/id/ko_012_0100_0010", "sourceId": "src-jipseong-ko_012", "subjectClasses": [], "text": "豐\n○ 天命赤烏, 與兵徼期, 征伐無道, 箕子遊遨.", "title": "豐", "translation": null, "translationSource": null}
